# A git repository of its own. `frontend/*` did not keep it out: an embedded
# repo is added as a single gitlink at `frontend`, with no trailing component
# for `/*` to match, so `git add -A` swept it in as a submodule with no
# `.gitmodules` behind it. The directory form matches the entry itself.
frontend/
docs/issues/*
